etics  in different animals and what we are  doing  also right now is to try our antibodies  in vivo  we have a mouse model  the transgenic human race to  a mice model that we are currently  trying to see whether our antibodies can  provide therapy for a copied infection  cognitive infection of these animals  so this is what where we are now and we  hope to  establish the clinical steps  in a few months and go to directly  thank you so much and dr majora thank  you for your time today for your  presentation  and also for your important research and  i want to thank our audience members for  their outstanding questions  dr mazur will be moving into the expert  lounge right after this talk to continue  discussing his presentation  and answering questions submitted during  the presentation  and this presentation will be available  on demand  viewing through 12 months from today  so all the way up to next year 2021  in october and please share it with your  colleague who may have be  interested in today's topic thank you  again for your participation  and see you in that expert lounge take  care everyone  go bye and stay healthy thank you dr  missouri  thank you bye

